{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21040","headline":"感讽六首 三 · 李贺","name":"感讽六首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杂杂胡马尘，森森边士戟。\n天教胡马战，晓云皆血色。\n妇人携汉卒，箭箙囊巾帼。\n不慙金印重，踉蹡腰鞬力。\n恂恂乡门老，昨夜试锋镝。\n走马遣书勳，谁能分粉墨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}